- make sure the bundle ID's capabilities (Sign in with Apple, Associated Domains, Push) are on the App Store profile;
- create the App Store Connect app record and put its ascAppId, or an ASC API key, into eas.json submit.production, which is empty today (eas.json:23-25).
The App Store seller name will be Hussain's legal name.

