findings.fix:
Paste this into SmartCompareApp/eas.json. Placeholders only, no secrets.
"submit": {
  "production": {
    "ios": {
      "ascAppId": "<numeric Apple ID from App Store Connect > App Information>",
      "appleTeamId": "8K562M549D",
      "ascApiKeyPath": "<ABSOLUTE path outside the repo>/AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8",
      "ascApiKeyIssuerId": "<issuer UUID from ASC > Users and Access > Integrations>",
      "ascApiKeyId": "<KEY_ID>"
    }
  }
}
If the API key is stored on EAS instead, drop the three ascApiKey* lines. Optional additions: "groups": ["<TestFlight internal group>"] and "language": "en-US".
